preter (once; a failure leaves the"] [126 1 "// runtime's own finder)."] [155 2 "// the runtime's finder leaves sys.meta_path: importlib's importers take its place"] [190 2 "// _frozen_importlib_external's spec (_setup ran before it existed)"] [196 2 "// the modules the runtime's own finder loaded while importlib was being installed (_io's _pyio, os ...)"] [197 2 "// get their specs from their files, as importlib's SourceFileLoader would have given them"] [199 2 "// zipimport.zipimporter first among the path hooks (_PyImportZip_Init); a failure is ignored, as CPython's"] [254 1 "// frozenGlobals is a frozen module's namespace before its code runs: __origname__, as"] [255 1 "// PyImport_ImportFrozenModuleObject sets it (FrozenImporter._fix_up_module pops it)."] [262 1 "// fixFrozenSpec gives a frozen module run before its importer existed its spec (_setup's loop's work)."] [287 1 "// importlibFindAndLoad is an import sys.modules does not answer, by importlib (handled false: the runtime's"] [288 1 "// own import, while importlib is being installed or when it cannot be)."] [304 1 "// removeImportlibFrames is import.c's remove_importlib_frames: the traceback of an import's error loses"] [305 1 "// importlib's frames (all of them for an ImportError, else the chunks ending in _call_with_frames_removed)."] [316 2 "// prev points at the link to the current entry; outer at the link to the current importlib chunk"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[83 41] [85 24] [91 24] [91 32] [106 25] [156 52] [159 33] [169 51] [176 106] [183 34] [186 60] [192 45] [200 43] [201 50] [202 55] [229 37] [230 49] [240 36] [264 35] [279 57] [282 54] [293 36] [321 16] [321 27]] :go/trails [[65 80]]} (go/file "imp_bootstrap.go" :imports [


